<title>SWITZERLAND: SIG 1996 sales higher.</title>
<headline>SIG 1996 sales higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEUHAUSEN, Switzerland 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group sales		    1,638	     vs 1,566</p>
<p> Orders received		1,692	     vs 1,517</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Swiss mechanical engineering group is SIG Schweizerische Industrie-Gesellschaft Holding AG. SIG in a statement said the 1995 comparison figures were revised to reflect the sale of its railroad car division .</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
